  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=6999269ee62f4695b39c83f79d6a4ff0",
  "detail_text": "This Special Notice (SN) is intended to alert the scientific community to a newly approved Advanced Research Projects Agency for Health (ARPA-H) solicitation and notify potential proposers of an associated Proposers’ Day (PD) sponsored by the Health Science Futures (HSF) Office. Under the cognizance of the HSF Office, ARPA-H is publishing an Innovative Solutions Opening (ISO) for the Technology InteGrator and AcceleratoR (TIGAR) Exploratory Topic on April 22nd, 2026. Please monitor SAM.gov for updates to the ISO ARPA-H-SOL-26-144 . For additional PD details see the attached notice ARPA-H-SN-26-142. Amendment 1 Amendment 1 of the SN updated the webinar and webinar registration dates, as well as relevant links.",
